      "summary": "Dream",
      "description": "Steve was making fun on my inability to make career decisions and drove the car in to a ditch where construction workers were working on sewage\nThe dogs we running away around the car from an angry cat once it was recovered I felt like being mean to the cat\nIn a food court someone ordered 8 dishes so I didn't order anything from the restaurant that I wanted and complained to Iga about\nI was relaxing watching TV and someone was following up after a recruiter submitted me I complained about how late it was and how stupid their questions were asking what were my three recent failures\n1) I didn't speak up when my boss asked me to work on something I knew would fail\n2) I didn't express my needs because I thought I was entitled to nothing and I let that fact frustrate me\n3) I built a rigid platform that was too hard to change and maintain\nI hung up on the lady calling for the interview because she wasn't speaking\nI looked up the person online and she has some sort of women's retail business",
